      "beat_id": "B02",
      "act": "body",
      "narration_text": "Fluent text is persuasive. It reads like someone careful wrote it, whether or not anyone did. That's exactly why verification is its own skill. You don't check the writing. You check each claim, one at a time, against a source.",
