      "beat_id": "B06",
      "act": "body",
      "narration_text": "But look at what the gate actually checks. Only that the file exists and isn't empty. If Claude wrote that file itself, the gate would open, and nobody would have checked anything. The code can't tell a real signature from a fake one.",
